---------------------------------
README file for ip support module
---------------------------------

The ip module has support for serial devices.  
There is documentation for it in file documentation/ipDoc.html
Some of the links seem to be broken.

The ip module is part of SynApps which originally covered all serial
devices.  Now many of those devices have their own separate modules so
check for one of those before using support from this module.

It is still in use at DLS for a few devices.

README last updated 02/03/2020
